  "bug_info": "Summary of configuration for Project: JxPath\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Script dir: /root/defects4j/framework\n      Base dir: /root/defects4j\n    Major root: /root/defects4j/major\n      Repo dir: /root/defects4j/project_repos\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Project ID: JxPath\n       Program: commons-jxpath\n    Build file: /root/defects4j/framework/projects/JxPath/JxPath.build.xml\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n           Vcs: Vcs::Git\n    Repository: /root/defects4j/project_repos/commons-jxpath.git\n     Commit db: /root/defects4j/framework/projects/JxPath/active-bugs.csv\nNumber of bugs: 22\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSummary for Bug: JxPath-21\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRevision ID (fixed version):\n99a20785daf2bfc018552e2eabed1067bf225013\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRevision date (fixed version):\n2011-06-08 18:19:50 +0000\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBug report id:\nJXPATH-151\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBug report url:\nhttps://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/JXPATH-151\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRoot cause in triggering tests:\n - org.apache.commons.jxpath.ri.model.JXPath151Test::testMapValueEquality\n   --> junit.framework.AssertionFailedError: Evaluating <map/b != map/a> expected:<true> but was:<false>\n - org.apache.commons.jxpath.ri.model.MixedModelTest::testNull\n   --> junit.framework.AssertionFailedError: Evaluating value iterator <$testnull/nothing[1]> expected:<[null]> but was:<[]>\n------------------------------------------------------------